			"widgets_values":[
				"**中文提示词：**\n\n镜头从一个低角度开始，聚焦在椅子的金属脚轮上，镜头缓慢向上移动，逐渐展现出椅子光滑的木质扶手和柔软的灰色皮革表面。通过50mm浅景深镜头，突出椅子表面的纹理细节，光线柔和，窗帘的自然光线洒在椅背上，产生温暖的光影效果。画面切换至一个45度斜侧角度，展示椅子与背景中绿色植物和金属柜的和谐搭配，强调现代简约的室内设计风格。最后，镜头平滑拉远，展现整个场景，椅子成为房间的焦点，带出一种安静而优雅的氛围。\n\n---\n\n**English Prompt:**\n\nThe camera begins with a low-angle shot, focusing on the metal casters of the chair, slowly tilting upward to reveal the smooth wooden armrests and the soft gray leather surface. Using a 50mm shallow depth-of-field lens, the texture details of the chair's surface are highlighted, with soft lighting casting warm shadows from the natural light through the curtains onto the chair's backrest. The shot transitions to a 45-degree side angle, showcasing the chair in harmony with the green plants and metallic cabinet in the background, emphasizing a modern minimalist interior design style. Finally, the camera smoothly pulls back to reveal the entire scene, positioning the chair as the focal point of the room, evoking a serene and elegant atmosphere."
